{"version":1,"content":"<p>對於當下所有手機廠商而言，持續走高的存儲晶片價格正在直接推高整機生產成本，要是廠商一味選擇把上漲的成本全部轉嫁到終端售價上，直接給產品大幅提價，最終只會倒逼越來越多的用户放棄換新機，逐步遠離自家品牌。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583662.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T06:31:38.860293+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:17:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:27:48.697017+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T06:27:48.697017+00:00","content_hash":"665a882ebcdcabf1bf1b6d5964c31a307f03f7163fc9c8bddd6854269555e9ad","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}